    {
      "source": "An exception handling <a href=\"WebSocketHandlerDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.handler\"><code>WebSocketHandlerDecorator</code></a>.\nTraps all <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Throwable</code></a> instances that escape from the decorated\nhandler and closes the session with <a href=\"../CloseStatus.html#SERVER_ERROR\"><code>CloseStatus.SERVER_ERROR</code></a>.",
      "translation": "异常处理装饰器<a href=\"WebSocketHandlerDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.handler\"><code>WebSocketHandlerDecorator</code></a>。捕获所有从被装饰的处理器中逃逸的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Throwable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Throwable</code></a> 实例，并使用<a href=\"../CloseStatus.html#SERVER_ERROR\"><code>CloseStatus.SERVER_ERROR</code></a>关闭会话。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked after WebSocket negotiation has succeeded and the WebSocket connection is\nopened and ready for use.",
      "translation": "WebSocket 协商成功后且 WebSocket 连接已打开并准备就绪时调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
